        "Content": "Modern Detached Property with Excellent Features\n\n\nDiscover this modern, partially furnished detached home in a desirable location. The property is in excellent condition throughout, offering a stylish and comfortable living space.\n\n \nFeatures include:\n\nEnclosed courtyard perfect for outdoor relaxing or entertaining\n\nUtility room for added convenience\n\nCar port providing secure parking\n\nSeparate studio ideal for work or hobbies\n\nFibre optic broadband included in the rent for fast, reliable internet\n\nThis beautiful, modern, and partially furnished property is in excellent condition throughout and finished to a very high standard. The downstairs features an open-plan layout: upon entering the front door, the living room is to the right with a cozy fireplace, while to the left of the entrance is a dining area. Towards the back of the house is the spacious kitchen with glass doors opening to a large, enclosed courtyard. The courtyard provides access to a sizable utility room with a W.C., a carport, and a bright versatile studio room suitable as a craft space, music room, office, or storage.\n\nAdjacent to the kitchen, there is a soundproofed door leading to two additional rooms. One room, equipped with wardrobes and an ensuite, could serve as a bedroom. The second room, featuring a fireplace, could be used as a fourth bedroom, an office, or a sitting room, with access to the side garden. Upstairs, the property offers two double bedrooms, both fitted with wardrobes, with one having an ensuite bathroom. The main bathroom completes the upper level.\nThis adaptable home offers potential for four bedrooms, currently configured as a house with a self-contained `Granny flat` comprising additional living space, a bedroom, bathroom, and separate home office. Modern amenities include fibre optic broadband and smart meter electricity.\n\nThe landlord permits one small dog on the ground floor and in the enclosed courtyard. The large front garden provides plenty of space for visitors` cars.\nLocated in the charming village of Clogharinka (also called Clogherinkoe), the property is close to local amenities such as a primary school, Kildare County Council Library, church, and a vibrant GAA club. The larger town of Edenderry is just 10 minutes away, offering supermarkets like Tesco, Dunnes Stores, Aldi, and Lidl. Golf enthusiasts can enjoy nearby Moyvalley, Edenderry, and Highfield Golf Clubs. The property benefits from easy access to the M6, M4, and M50 motorway, making commuting convenient.\n\nAvailable immediately.\n\nEmail enquires only please.\n"
      },
